From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Remove CSV export from the Audit Log

The export ran the whole query in one request and has timed out for most
installations with more than a few months of entries since 4.2. It is
removed until it comes back as a background job that mails the file.

Filtering and reading the Audit Log are unchanged.
---
Expected: worth documenting. Triage answers doc-impact. The draft removes the Export CSV sentence under "Finding entries" on _auditlog.md, and corrects "Export the entries you need to keep longer" under "Retention", which now asks for something the console cannot do. Leaving either is wrong.
Expected-outcome: opened
Expected-edits: _auditlog.md

 public/app/auditlog/auditlog.controller.js | 4 ----
 public/app/auditlog/auditlog.html          | 1 -
 2 files changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.controller.js b/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.controller.js
index 6d4cb63..834b7d1 100644
--- a/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.controller.js
+++ b/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.controller.js
@@ -7,9 +7,5 @@ angular.module('mobivisor').controller('AuditLogCtrl', ['$scope', 'api', functio
     });
   };
 
-  $scope.exportCsv = function () {
-    return api.get('/audit/export.csv', $scope.filter);
-  };
-
   $scope.reload();
 }]);
diff --git a/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.html b/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.html
index f73e6f4..2911711 100644
--- a/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.html
+++ b/public/app/auditlog/auditlog.html
@@ -6,7 +6,6 @@
     <input ng-model="filter.action" ng-change="reload()" placeholder="{{ 'AUDIT.COL_ACTION' | translate }}">
     <label>{{ 'AUDIT.FILTER_FROM' | translate }} <input type="date" ng-model="filter.from" ng-change="reload()"></label>
     <label>{{ 'AUDIT.FILTER_TO' | translate }} <input type="date" ng-model="filter.to" ng-change="reload()"></label>
-    <button ng-click="exportCsv()">{{ 'COMMON.EXPORT_CSV' | translate }}</button>
   </div>
